	// MECHANISM-1: QueueDepth penalty double-counts with EffectiveLoad penalty causing over-spreading; instead, scaling down prefix bonus when instance is overloaded redirects traffic from hot-spotted cache-warm instances
	// EXPECT-1: load_spikes_e2e_ms < 3300
